    "created_at": "2016-09-15T12:31:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-15T12:31:12Z",
    "body": "Neither Chromium, Gecko or WebKit sources have the string \"concept-top-layer\" anywhere, and Edge is waiting for Chrome to ship unprefixed Fullscreen, so it's unlikely they've added a comment either.\n\nIt seems like an accident that it's #top-layer but #concept-top-layer-add/remove, and an accident that can trivially be undone since it was so recent. I didn't expect any resistance whatsoever :)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
